{
    "title": "Grab Driver: App for Partners",
    "description": "Hello Driver Partners,\r\n\r\nWe're excited to be on this journey with you. Partnering with us helps to boost your earning potential and build a sustainable livelihood. \r\n\r\nGrab is Southeast Asia's leading superapp. We offer essential everyday services to over 670 million people across Singapore, Indonesia, Malaysia, Thailand, Philippines, Vietnam, Cambodia, and Myanmar. It is our mission to drive Southeast Asia forward by creating economic empowerment for you and everyone in the region.\r\n\r\nBy signing up as a Grab partner you have a unique combination of flexibility and stability: \r\n- You get to be your own boss - decide when, where and how often you want to work.\r\n- Maintain a source of reliable earnings - Grab gives you access to millions of customers, instant cash out options, loyalty programs and even upskilling opportunities to help you plan your future.\r\n- You could choose to drive passengers or deliver food and other packages, or do all of these with just a single app. And you will have the most committed Grab Support teams waiting to serve you around the clock when you need help.\r\n\r\nFind out more about us at www.grab.com.\r\n\r\nGrab offers the ability for users to receive personalised targeted advertising, offers and updates from Grab and its partners and communications/advertising from certain third party apps based on activity on your devices. Users may exercise opt-out choices under the Privacy and Consent Management sections within Settings within the app. For further details, you may refer to our Privacy Policy at www.grab.com/privacy.\r\n\r\nOpen source software attribution: www.grb.to/oss-attributions",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hello Driver Partners,<br><br>We&#39;re excited to be on this journey with you. Partnering with us helps to boost your earning potential and build a sustainable livelihood. <br><br>Grab is Southeast Asia&#39;s leading superapp. We offer essential everyday services to over 670 million people across Singapore, Indonesia, Malaysia, Thailand, Philippines, Vietnam, Cambodia, and Myanmar. It is our mission to drive Southeast Asia forward by creating economic empowerment for you and everyone in the region.<br><br>By signing up as a Grab partner you have a unique combination of flexibility and stability: <br>- You get to be your own boss - decide when, where and how often you want to work.<br>- Maintain a source of reliable earnings - Grab gives you access to millions of customers, instant cash out options, loyalty programs and even upskilling opportunities to help you plan your future.<br>- You could choose to drive passengers or deliver food and other packages, or do all of these with just a single app. And you will have the most committed Grab Support teams waiting to serve you around the clock when you need help.<br><br>Find out more about us at www.grab.com.<br><br>Grab offers the ability for users to receive personalised targeted advertising, offers and updates from Grab and its partners and communications/advertising from certain third party apps based on activity on your devices. Users may exercise opt-out choices under the Privacy and Consent Management sections within Settings within the app. For further details, you may refer to our Privacy Policy at www.grab.com/privacy.<br><br>Open source software attribution: www.grb.to/oss-attributions",
